  <ns2:Class rdf:about="https://cropontology.org/rdf/CO_358:0000995">
    <ns1:definition xml:lang="en">Verticillium wilt severity (or disease infection index) is calculated in plant mature stage. the formula is: DI=[Ʃ(Ni × i)/(N × i)] × 100, Where i is the maximum disease grade, Ni, the number of plants with corresponding disease grade and N the number of total investigated plants</ns1:definition>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">VWDS - Computation</rdfs:label>
